s (which I should)", "timestamp": 1792458072, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "the_edward.black", "author_id": "2229217777", "id": "18158434768447809", "text": "As a game designer I say, this is AI generated tips, not actual how to make good boss", "timestamp": 1792418420, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ellzy91", "author_id": "54222448429", "id": "18130033213867827", "text": "I need 2d tutorial account please but im keep watching this account too", "timestamp": 1792413174, "like_count": 2}, {"author": "lanedefensegame", "author_id": "23815952767", "id": "17885461257688333", "text": "The entrance is a great place to establish a boss\u2019s scale before the fight starts. A brief silhouette reveal can make that first beat land\u2014what game mechanic would you like to break down next?", "timestamp": 1792411125, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "akiferkal06", "author_id": "39361123375", "id": "18132254812776766", "text": "SFX", "timestamp": 1792404303, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ilann68", "author_id": "9171576806", "id": "18427655785158939", "text": "SFX", "timestamp": 1792391111, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "astral_scuttle", "author_id": "35360435433", "id": "17911141137480265", "text": "SFX", "timestamp": 1792384674, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "motionbykrit", "author_id": "18351117666", "id": "18284816080288685", "text": "COMMENT \"SFX\" and I'll send you the SFX pack!", "timestamp": 1792384594, "like_count": 1}, {"author": "rageguard2", "author_id": "79748479754", "id": "18106997908970866", "text": "This is just what I needed, currently the boss in my game feels like another basic enemy", "timestamp": 1792381801, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "cuttly78", "author_id": "14967718511", "id": "18031198265886880", "text": "\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25\ud83d\udd25", "timestamp": 1792378109, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "tomatosoup.grilledcheese.v3", "author_id": "69051328962", "id": "17904286920362543", "text": "Oh! Can you do one on stylized movement? Kind of like Mario or Pacman